        <headline>Warning to Sheep Graziers for Flinders forecast district</headline>
        <description>Sheep graziers are warned that cold temperatures, showers and westerly winds are expected during Wednesday. Areas likely to be affected include parts of the Flinders forecast district. There is a risk of losses of lambs and sheep exposed to these conditions.</description>
